      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T12:21:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of hard-coding a hash into pvmfw, can\u0027t we use a vbmeta property to tag the image as a service VM? How\u0027s this setup going to work with updatable VMs?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 141,
        "startChar": 37,
        "endLine": 141,
        "endChar": 64
      },
      "revId": "c5d06568551777db46a2668cc6b120175c174ab3",
